      "effect": "Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing 1 \"Cyber\" Spell/Trap from your GY. If this card is Special Summoned: You can add 1 Machine \"Cyber\" monster from your Deck to your hand, except \"Cyber Thuban\". If this card is sent to the GY: You can activate this effect; your opponent cannot activate cards or effects when you Special Summon a Level 10 LIGHT Machine monster(s) this turn. You can only use each effect of \"Cyber Thuban\" once per turn.",
